This project is an independent DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 adaptation of:

  @lyd123qw2008/dsh-web-search-codex version 0.1.3
  https://github.com/lyd123qw2008/pi-websearch/tree/main/dsh-web-search-codex
  npm: https://www.npmjs.com/package/@lyd123qw2008/dsh-web-search-codex
  repository gitHead: 2a4496ccb73d7d5589d741c0cf78a188ffbd5aec

The upstream package declares license MIT. This adaptation retains its native
Responses transport approach, volatile-configuration integration pattern,
structured citation projection, and incremental SSE parser. New work adds a
DSH 0.2.0 bundle, desktop configuration card, explicit peer compatibility,
forced native search, complete tool sources, stricter failure handling,
timeouts, tests, and release packaging.

Configuration UI integration follows the public DSH 0.2.0-rc.2 APIs and MIT
implementation patterns of @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-web-search.
DeepSeek Harness: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

This is not an official DeepSeek, OpenAI, or Sub2API release.
